# Full-top IHP mapping, NOT wired into the Makefile.
#
# The top-level coarse netlist is ~109k cells with hundreds of wide
# multipliers and adders. ``techmap`` expands them into millions of gates and
# exceeds the 16 GB Docker VM used during development, so this target is kept
# for reference only. Use ``make ihp`` (block-level) instead.
#
# __LIBERTY__ is substituted by synth/synth.sh.
synth -top qr_acc_top -run begin:fine
techmap
dfflibmap -liberty __LIBERTY__
abc -fast -liberty __LIBERTY__
opt_clean
tee -o physical/reports/ihp_top_check.rpt check
tee -o physical/reports/ihp_top_area.rpt stat -liberty __LIBERTY__
write_verilog -noattr -noexpr physical/build/ihp/qr_acc_top.v
